          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Paper, wood-containing, LWC, at regional storage
na;
UUID: 9588954d-30d9-3bed-8235-2470d454b132
This module includes the transport from the production site to a central distribution site within average Europe for the domestic and the foreign LWC paper consumed in average Europe.; Geography: Deliveries within Europe according to CEPI statistics. 
Location:  Deliveries within Europe according to CEPI statistics. 
Technology: Average situation
Time period: &lt;null&gt;
Production volume: Total European consumption 2000: 6'971 kt (CEPI statistics)
Sampling: &lt;null&gt;
Extrapolations: Standard distances for domestic production, imports from CEPI countries and imports from outside.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_9588954d-30d9-3bed-8235-2470d454b132.xml</text>
